<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Radio raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has raised its rating for American Radio Systems Corp to buy from outperform, a source at the firm said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares closed at 28-1/4 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
